Package: b10prot
Title: Protein Identification for Shotgun Proteomics Data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Gorka", "Prieto", email = "gorka.prieto@ehu.eus", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6433-8452"))
Description: A package for processing shotgun proteomics data to identify and
    infer proteins. The input consists of Peptide-to-Spectrum Matches (PSMs) 
    read from mzIdentML files using the mzR package. False positives are 
    controlled using various FDR estimations based on the target-decoy approach 
    and LPGF identification scores. Protein groups are formed using the 
    PAnalyzer algorithm.
